From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:46:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let a theme style menu sliders' value, track and knob

A menu slider drew its value in ES's own light font at the slider's
height (about 7 px on a 480 px screen), a 2 px track in the text
colour that did not show the level, and a knob 0.7 times the
slider's height.

menuSlider gains a font for the value, the track's colour and
thickness, a fill colour for the track left of the knob, and the
knob's size. Without them sliders are unchanged.
---
 THEMES.md                                  | 18 +++++++++++++++++-
 es-core/src/ThemeData.cpp                  | 22 +++++++++++++++++++++-
 es-core/src/ThemeData.h                    | 11 +++++++++++
 es-core/src/components/SliderComponent.cpp | 22 +++++++++++++++++-----
 4 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/THEMES.md b/THEMES.md
index 42505f0d..936d3928 100644
--- a/THEMES.md
+++ b/THEMES.md
@@ -830,7 +830,7 @@ ES versions with slides support the feature `slideshow`.
 	
 * `menuSwitch name="menuswitch"` - PATHON | PATHOFF
 	- Images for the on/off switch in menus
-* `menuSlider name="menuslider"` - PATH
+* `menuSlider name="menuslider"` - PATH | FONTPATH | FONTSIZE | TRACKCOLOR | FILLCOLOR | TRACKSIZE | KNOBSIZE
 	- Image for the slider knob in menus
 * `menuButton name="menubutton"` - PATH | FILLEDPATH | CORNERSIZE | COLOR | FILLEDCOLOR | HEIGHT
 	- Images for menu buttons
@@ -1506,6 +1506,22 @@ BATOCERA 5.24 - replace the button images in menus
 * `height` - type: FLOAT.
   - The buttons' least height, as a fraction of the screen height. Default: the label's height.
 
+#### menuSlider
+
+* `path` - type: PATH.
+  - The knob's image.
+* `fontPath` - type: PATH.
+* `fontSize` - type: FLOAT.
+  - The value's font. Default: ES's light font, as high as the slider.
+* `trackColor` - type: COLOR.
+  - The track's colour. Default: the menu text's colour.
+* `fillColor` - type: COLOR.
+  - The track's colour left of the knob. Default: as the rest of the track.
+* `trackSize` - type: FLOAT.
+  - The track's thickness, as a fraction of the screen height. Default is 2 pixels.
+* `knobSize` - type: FLOAT.
+  - The knob's height, as a fraction of the screen height. Default: 0.7 times the slider's height.
+
 #### menuTextEdit
 
 BATOCERA 5.24 - replace the textbox background images in OSK
